	"briefing": [
		"This is it, Commander. The Aurora Lance stands on the north-eastern shoulder of Mount Belov. According to Doctor Varga it will reach full charge at midnight - in thirty minutes - and Premier Vasko will fire it at Geneva.",
		"The Lance is defended by Colonel Strel's Aurora Guard: Arc Towers, flak, and Titan siege tanks. Between you and it sits the Pact's main army group, which will counter-attack hard. The Lance can strike anything that comes close with lightning.",
		"You have everything the Concord can give you, including Hawk gunships and the full Tech Center arsenal. Varga says the Lance's shield draws on the power plants that ring it - destroy them, and its defences go dark. Then bring it down."
	],
